                    <hi rendition="#italic">General Lee to Mr. Day.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Havana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-01-25"><hi rendition="#italic">January 25,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Another German naval vessel arrived this morning. Peace and quiet reign.</p>
